#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:363
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:366
msgid ""
"Can a User Manager or System Manager reset an administrator’s email or "
"password without their knowledge?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:368
msgid ""
"This is not possible with the default privileges of these roles. The "
"ability to reset passwords or email addresses of administrators is "
"limited to system admins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:371
msgid "Can a User Manager or System Manager access the configuration file?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:373
msgid ""
"Yes. However, they will only have access to read actual values and modify"
" values in accordance with their permissions. If appropriate read "
"permissions do not exist, the default key values will be displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:376
msgid "Are all actions of admin roles logged?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:378
msgid "Every change made by any admin is included in the audit log."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:381
msgid "Can a System Manager change their own permissions or elevate their role?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:383
msgid ""
"No. System Managers can't elevate their role, and aren't able to elevate "
"other members' roles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:386
msgid ""
"Can any of the new roles view API keys/passwords or other sensitive "
"information within the System Console (such as SMTP, AWS, Elastic "
"Search)?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:388
msgid ""
"No, password information is only visible to system admins and is "
"obfuscated for other roles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:391
msgid ""
"If download links for compliance exports are enabled in the System "
"Console, can a Read Only Admin download the reports?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:393
msgid ""
"Only roles that are explicitly granted access to **System Console > "
"Compliance** have access to download compliance reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:396
msgid "Can any of the new roles force-join Private channels?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:398
msgid ""
"Yes at this time they can, however, we will be improving on this behavior"
" in the future with a prompt that lets them know they are entering a "
"private channel. We are also planning on adding a permission which would "
"remove the ability to access Private channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:401
msgid "Can I create a new role or clone an existing role?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:403
msgid "No, but we are actively seeking feedback on this capability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:406
msgid "Can I use an LDAP filter to assign these roles?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:408
msgid "No, but we are considering this functionality for a future enhancement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:411
msgid "Can I rename the roles?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:413
msgid "This is being considered for future development."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:416
msgid ""
"Can a System Manager or User Manager demote or deactivate another Admin "
"or Manager?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:418
msgid ""
"A System or User Manager can demote or deactivate another System or User "
"Manager, but can't demote or deactivate a system admin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:421
msgid "Can a System Manager or User Manager assign or unassign admin roles?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/delegated-granular-administration.rst:423
msgid "Only the system admin has access to edit system roles."
msgstr ""

